## File: src/attune_author/mcp/handlers.py

The handlers also use `.help` as the default, e.g.:

```python
help_dir = params.get("help_dir", ".help")
```

The default value of the `help_dir` argument across the MCP tools is **`".help"`**.

(Note: `author_init` is the exception — it takes `project_dir` instead of `help_dir`, with a default of `"."`, since its job is to *create* the `.help/` directory structure.)

